OL,3,GNEWSAFormer detective jailed after
OL,4,Aillegally passing on information to man
OL,5,Ashe knew
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former detective has been jailed for
OL,8,Feight months for illegally accessing
OL,9,Fpolice logs about a man she knew and
OL,10,Fpassing information onto him.
OL,12,FEmma Gardner, 47, from Colwyn Bay,
OL,13,FConwy, accessed restricted logs related
OL,14,Fto him and three others, despite having
OL,15,Fno professional reason to view the
OL,16,Ffiles.
OL,18,FThe former detective inspector with
OL,19,FNorth Wales Police had denied
OL,20,Funauthorised access to computer
OL,21,Fmaterial in 2022 but was found guilty
OL,22,Fby a jury.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
