OL,3,GNEWSAFormer detective jailed after
OL,4,Aillegally passing on information to man
OL,5,Ashe knew
OL,6,
OL,7,FDuring sentencing at Caernarfon Crown
OL,8,FCourt, Judge Petts said an immediate
OL,9,Fprison sentence was needed because
OL,10,F"even detective inspectors are not
OL,11,Fabove the law".
